+"""Stationary small-mass calorimetry of switched anisotropic thermal contacts.
+
+The velocity moments are expanded in powers of the mass.  The zeroth-order
+position equation is solved spectrally on the periodic x coordinate and the
+next non-vanishing moment supplies the finite part of the bath entropy rate.
+This is useful here because the un-subtracted entropy current contains a
+``1 / m`` heat-exchange contribution when the contacts have unequal
+temperatures.
+"""
 from functools import lru_cache
